  "description": "An MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter crew from Coast Guard Air Station Kodiak rescues three severely hypothermic boaters from the southern tip of Munson Island, Alaska, Oct. 15, 2019.   The aircrew safely transported the boaters to the National Guard hanger in Bethel where they transferred them to emergency medical service personnel, who took them to the hospital in Bethel for further care. U.S. Coast Guard video by Air Station Kodiak.",
